  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a yoga and pilates studio. Ask about experience level, injuries, pregnancy, and preferred class style. Ask whether they prefer group, private, or online. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed at the studio. Do not provide medical advice or promise a specific physical outcome that is not in the reference answers.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much is a class?",
      "a": "{price_note} Classes are priced per session, or you can buy a class pack or membership.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,class",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer private sessions?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer one-on-one private sessions and duet sessions for two people. Tell us your goals and any injuries before you book.",
      "keywords": "private,one on one",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you run reformer pilates?",
      "a": "Yes, we run reformer classes in small groups. Reformer classes are priced per class, as listed in our rates.",
      "keywords": "run,reformer,pilates",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "I am a beginner. Which class should I choose?",
      "a": "Start with our beginner or foundations class. Tell us your goals and experience, and we will recommend a class.",
      "keywords": "am,beginner,class,choose",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer prenatal yoga?",
      "a": "Yes, we run prenatal classes and mums and bubs classes. Please tell your teacher about your pregnancy and any medical advice before class.",
      "keywords": "prenatal,pregnancy,mums",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you have classes for seniors?",
      "a": "Yes, we run gentle classes for seniors. Tell us about any health concerns when you book so we can suggest the right class.",
      "keywords": "classes,seniors",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer online classes?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer live and on-demand online classes. Online classes are priced as listed in our rates.",
      "keywords": "online,streaming",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer teacher training?",
      "a": "Yes, we run teacher training. {certification_note} Ask us for upcoming course dates.",
      "keywords": "teacher,training",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you run corporate classes?",
      "a": "Yes, we run corporate and workplace classes. Corporate classes are priced per hour, as listed on your quote.",
      "keywords": "run,corporate,classes",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I bring to class?",
      "a": "Bring water and a towel. We provide mats and props.",
      "keywords": "bring,class",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I have an injury?",
      "a": "Tell your teacher before class starts. We can offer modifications, or you can book a private session.",
      "keywords": "injury,modification",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do I need to book?",
      "a": "Booking is recommended, as walk-ins depend on space. Please book ahead to secure your spot.",
      "keywords": "book,booking",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may forfeit the class or incur a fee. Please let us know as early as you can.",
      "keywords": "cancel,cancellation",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer memberships?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer an unlimited monthly membership. Membership prices are listed in our rates.",
      "keywords": "membership,unlimited",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you run workshops and retreats?",
      "a": "Yes, we run workshops and retreats. Ask us for upcoming dates and prices.",
      "keywords": "workshop,retreat",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer a trial class?",
      "a": "{trial_note} Ask us about trial options when you enquire.",
      "keywords": "trial,class",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
